# Log: Designer Agent

## Format
```
[timestamp] [level] [message]
```

## Levels
- INFO: Normal operations
- WARN: Potential issues
- ERROR: Errors requiring attention

## Log Rotation
- Daily rotation
- Keep 30 days
- Archive old logs

## Example Entries
```
2026-07-27T10:00:00Z INFO Design system updated
2026-07-27T10:15:00Z INFO New component created: Button
2026-07-27T10:30:00Z WARN Accessibility issue found in Footer
2026-07-27T10:45:00Z ERROR Failed to load design tokens
```
